{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Journey's Spirit is an action RPG epic adventure. Use the elements of nature during combat. Adapt your equipment along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a fantasy kingdom seized by demonic forces, the hero must reclaim his honor by saving his comrades from the hands of the Darkest Warlock by crushing him.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">                        \u2013 <strong>Exploration!</strong> Combat enemies, defeat bosses, complete quests, and reveal the map, while discovering new materials, consumables, and armor in the meantime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 <strong>Elements!</strong> Elemental powers impose various statuses. Adapting tactics won't get you bored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 <strong>Reactions!</strong> Combinations of elements lead to various effects like chain lightning or explosions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 <strong>Skills!</strong> Armor gives skills that influence the approach to combat and the usage of elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 <strong>Items!</strong> Craft consumables from gathered materials and use them to apply elements or for other effects.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Developers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is developed by one person \u2013 Aleksei Chistov, a self-taught programmer who brings Journey's Spirit to life without the use of game engines.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3592760?t=1745940666","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592760/3c9fa4b3a7b1caa508df5655ff120499d3c49e02/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745940666","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592760/99efa7b52d1b92249ba8c4200b534b7588fb9f5e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745940666","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592760/99efa7b52d1b92249ba8c4200b534b7588fb9f5e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745940666","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Journey's Spirit is an action RPG epic adventure. Use the elements of nature during combat. Adapt your equipment along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a fantasy kingdom seized by demonic forces, the hero must reclaim his honor by saving his comrades from the hands of the Darkest Warlock by crushing him.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">                        \u2013 <strong>Exploration!</strong> Combat enemies, defeat bosses, complete quests, and reveal the map, while discovering new materials, consumables, and armor in the meantime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 <strong>Elements!</strong> Elemental powers impose various statuses. Adapting tactics won't get you bored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 <strong>Reactions!</strong> Combinations of elements lead to various effects like chain lightning or explosions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 <strong>Skills!</strong> Armor gives skills that influence the approach to combat and the usage of elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 <strong>Items!</strong> Craft consumables from gathered materials and use them to apply elements or for other effects.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Developers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is developed by one person \u2013 Aleksei Chistov, a self-taught programmer who brings Journey's Spirit to life without the use of game engines.</p>","developers":["Hulvdan"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592760/e61855c0d1b351614b0f021d029f48ca9550c3fa/header.jpg?t=1745940666","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Min